{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an astronomer in The Observatory; a short 3D first-person cosmic horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work through the night shift from midnight to 6AM each week, capturing images of space phenomena through a high powered telescope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Name and document your discoveries and come to regret your profession,   <br> as you soon realize space isn't as empty as they say.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short Cosmic Horror game inspired by H.P Lovecraft and Junji Ito stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Megalophobia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden secrets and easter eggs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/76611c0f3cb81cc5901ec8f374837508.avif?t=1753723119\" /></div> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836910?t=1753723119","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836910?t=1753723119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/4bb2417d8db1b7b6e3c015d0a83101cde07108d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753723119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/4bb2417d8db1b7b6e3c015d0a83101cde07108d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753723119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an astronomer in The Observatory; a short 3D first-